ined by a power cable, who defend a core against an invading machine army.\n\nEach wave starts with a preparation phase in which the players build turrets, helper-bots and pallet walls before a siren starts the siege. During the siege the operators' weapons fire automatically alongside the turrets and bots, and the run ends if the core is destroyed. Staying close along the power cable raises both players' damage and lets the cable shock robots, while a market between waves offers items that can be rerolled or locked and weapons that can be upgraded and combined.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/oktoraid"}